<%= scope(:popover_default_content, name: :sleep_stop, label: "Sleep Stop").render do %>
  <p>Allows you to set when your device should wake up. Requires corresponding start time. When asleep, this will dynamically adjust your <em>Refresh Rate</em> until your device wakes up again.</p>

  <p>💡 When editing this field, use <kbd>TAB</kbd> + <kbd>DELETE</kbd> to tab through and delete all values to clear this out.</p>
<% end %>
